  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD Internal Grant for Accompaniment of DFID CSO Food Security Project Oct 2010 - Spt 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project grant approval aims to enable CAFOD to provide support to Kitui and Isiolo Dioceses in the management and implemenation of the DFID funded Food Security Project mitigating the Impact of Economic downturn in Kitui and Isiolo dioceses. This will involve  engaging a CAFOD Livelihoods Programme Support Officer to provide additional accompaniment  to the diocesan partners, facilitating project setting up workshops, providing continuous monitoring and evaluation, facilitating programme learning and reporting  to the donor and coordinating with other sectoral agencies .</narrative>
  </description>
